# Vale: ``styles/`` holds project-shipped vocabularies under
# ``config/vocabularies/`` (committed) plus any external packages
# pulled by ``vale sync`` (NOT committed — they're downloads). Keep
# the project's vocab tracked, ignore the rest.
styles/*
!styles/config/

# Generated artifacts — anything a build/test step writes belongs
# under ``.artifacts/`` (separate from ``dist/`` for wheel/sdist
# output). Conformance suite outputs (``.artifacts/conformance/
# results/`` per-module JSON summaries, ``.artifacts/conformance/
# reports/`` plan HTML archives, ``.artifacts/conformance/
# diagnostic_export/`` suite-UI exports) live here so source-of-
# truth (``tests/conformance/*.py``, ``Dockerfile.provider``,
# ``expected_failures.json``) stays separate from ephemeral run-
# output. Defaults in ``run_per_module.sh`` and the README write
# under this prefix.
.artifacts/
